      ],
      "title": "afs: Validate vectorized strings",
      "message": "afs: Validate vectorized strings\n\nThe RXStringV type has one character (octet) stored per 32\nbit word. There's no real indication of the string encoding\n(possibly locale dependent, maybe ASCII or UTF-8.) Validate\nit as UTF-8 for now, to produce good UTF-8 and handle the latter\ntwo cases.\n\nFix #18583.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-11-06T08:43:31.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
